ipp-usb-assistant (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Unified deepin 25 (Qt 6 / DTK 6) and UOS 20 (Qt 5 / DTK 5) into a
    single source tree.
    - Added src/qtcompat.h to absorb Qt 5 / Qt 6 API migration.
    - CMakeLists.txt auto-detects Qt6 then falls back to Qt5, with DTK
      major version following the Qt major version.
    - CUPS detection falls back to find_path/find_library when cups.pc is
      missing (UOS 20's libcups2-dev ships no pkg-config file).
    - SANE detection falls back from sane-backends to sane.
  * Added debian-uos/ metadata and build-uos.sh for UOS 20 packaging.
  * Removed the unused diagnostics module (never referenced by the UI).
  * Robustness: look up services by unit name instead of relying on the
    order of the services() list.
  * Completed the English translation (171/171 messages).

 -- 克亮 <315707022@qq.com>  Mon, 1 Sep 2026 23:10:00 +0800

ipp-usb-assistant (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of ipp-usb-assistant.
  * IPP-USB environment detection with service control, offline install
    guidance and one-click reinstall.
  * Driverless printer discovery, queue management and PPD fine-tuning.
  * SANE/eSCL scanning with embedded preview, scan-source labelling
    (Flatbed/ADF) and ADF error handling.
  * Advanced filtering: whole-device quirk release and sane-airscan
    scan-channel exclusion (keeps driverless printing).

 -- 克亮 <315707022@qq.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0800
